				<string>BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;Coming This Month;;;
FN:Coming This Month
ORG:Fresh arrivals. Your couch is calling.
NOTE:coming
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;Last Call;;;
FN:Last Call
ORG:Watch before Netflix changes the locks.
NOTE:leaving
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;Next Month;;;
FN:Next Month
ORG:More reasons to cancel your plans.
NOTE:next
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;About &amp; Updates;;;
FN:About &amp; Updates
ORG:Created by SurfKraken. Built for the couch.
NOTE:about
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;Quit;;;
FN:Quit
ORG:Back to real life. Allegedly.
NOTE:quit
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD</string>
