END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;Leaving Next Month;;;
FN:Leaving Next Month
ORG:A little warning before the breakup.
NOTE:leaving
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:;Back;;;
FN:Back
ORG:Return to this month.
NOTE:back
PHOTO;ENCODING=b;TYPE=PNG:
END:VCARD</string>
