			<dict>
				<key>Text</key>
				<string>Netflix &amp; Chill
Created by SurfKraken
Version 1.0 / Build 100

Find what’s coming to and leaving Netflix in the US this month and next. Dates are selected automatically.

Source: What’s on Netflix RSS feeds. Guides open inside the shortcut, with the publisher’s artwork and credits intact. The feed has selected banners and stills, not a poster for every title.

Schedules can change. Leaving dates may be the first unavailable day, so watch before the listed date.

Internet required. The shortcut checks for updates each time it starts. It opens a newer release for you to review and install.

Unofficial. Not affiliated with Netflix or What’s on Netflix.
https://github.com/surfkraken/Netflix-and-Chill</string>
